[{:db/id "q-104294/selection/3057a31a98aa75b6fc26476976c1013093522e5d4fd7b8f41f9a7baf14381917" :answer/id #uuid "ba51f554-ce4f-5ab7-a740-8eaaa5435a50" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{{x}^{2}}-60x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104294/selection/24aaa8fe9c70aa2769120a00ed6c10ca18c1f1f0501c9d9cb7b11818407c790c" :answer/id #uuid "5a5f818b-faae-5b4c-9eef-5da2ba8aeee0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104294/selection/d60f27fa105631cb746991c903a9c00c49a67ff9319d71c3740ef4d948d311de" :answer/id #uuid "c74c4041-ddfc-538b-922c-0b1fa4e9ad14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{{x}^{3}}-60x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104294/selection/0c714e529845be675fcb7f9d7f719cbfdb73ad0b7815551ba74b7bf47302023e" :answer/id #uuid "91f888a7-1269-502b-b4d0-6e415369709b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{{x}^{3}}+\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{x}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104294/selection/1fc62802f0f456cd956f15f12ebe74e50dcf73deaa60ae395c0cb627a97b9eb6" :answer/id #uuid "c92e054e-f4f4-5d32-b855-65a5332dc288" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{{x}^{3}}-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{x}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104294/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a361d3a9-a14f-58ec-bcd6-8fbf7e08ce35" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-104294/selection/1fc62802f0f456cd956f15f12ebe74e50dcf73deaa60ae395c0cb627a97b9eb6" :answer-field/choices ["q-104294/selection/3057a31a98aa75b6fc26476976c1013093522e5d4fd7b8f41f9a7baf14381917" "q-104294/selection/24aaa8fe9c70aa2769120a00ed6c10ca18c1f1f0501c9d9cb7b11818407c790c" "q-104294/selection/d60f27fa105631cb746991c903a9c00c49a67ff9319d71c3740ef4d948d311de" "q-104294/selection/0c714e529845be675fcb7f9d7f719cbfdb73ad0b7815551ba74b7bf47302023e" "q-104294/selection/1fc62802f0f456cd956f15f12ebe74e50dcf73deaa60ae395c0cb627a97b9eb6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-104294" :question/id #uuid "a02d9322-995a-5ecd-8e4c-2a6f6de2c434" :question/math-academy-id "q-104294" :question/problem "Given $f(x)=2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-8\\sqrt{{x}^{5}},$ find ${f}^{‴}(x).$" :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-8\\sqrt{{x}^{5}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡x-8{x}^{5/2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{x}-20{x}^{3/2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{2}{x}-20{x}^{3/2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{-1}-20{x}^{3/2}) \\\\  & =-2{x}^{-2}-30{x}^{1/2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{x}^{-2}-30{x}^{1/2}) \\\\  & =4{x}^{-3}-15{x}^{-1/2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{{x}^{3}}-\\frac{15}{\\sqrt{x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-104294/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "322168bb-52e3-5352-a2e3-c5bdbf2bc13e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104294"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-310171/field-1/4e66c9855901c2bcde75b90bb1e89cffe664423139edde6f6f8ddde0f8bb6d5a" :answer/id #uuid "1e890c01-50d7-58fb-b218-eaa314e54cb4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\cos(x)-\\frac{6}{x^4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-310171/field-1/362b6717751dfd3d92784a65c5e1a811b7e6e1045e9dec6839f02ae1cac646ce" :answer/id #uuid "35d0af18-5e31-52a4-8fc4-704f25cc3950" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\cos(x)+\\frac{6}{x^4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-310171/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8cb7ab8c-4aec-566e-8339-637b3fb0343b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-310171/field-1/4e66c9855901c2bcde75b90bb1e89cffe664423139edde6f6f8ddde0f8bb6d5a" :answer-field/choices ["q-310171/field-1/4e66c9855901c2bcde75b90bb1e89cffe664423139edde6f6f8ddde0f8bb6d5a" "q-310171/field-1/362b6717751dfd3d92784a65c5e1a811b7e6e1045e9dec6839f02ae1cac646ce"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-310171" :question/id #uuid "dd9d0bd5-9503-5e7c-a782-f2aab6983086" :question/math-academy-id "q-310171" :question/problem "Find ${g}^{(4)}(x)$ for $g(x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡x.$\n\n${g}^{(4)}(x)=$ \n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡x) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+{x}^{-1}) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-{x}^{-2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-{x}^{-2}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+2{x}^{-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the fourth derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{(4)}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+2{x}^{-3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-6{x}^{-4} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{6}{{x}^{4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-310171/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "322168bb-52e3-5352-a2e3-c5bdbf2bc13e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-310171"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-342966/field-1/42d561329704e6c2c9d1f541f418dd1803436866104b56eeef292e4fe3f8c73f" :answer/id #uuid "ed6cabc6-019e-5cbc-8da7-a05d1c3fa2b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{2x\\sqrt{x}}-5\\cos(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342966/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "966c28f6-5176-53e7-aeb9-fc42b3b513e0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-342966/field-1/42d561329704e6c2c9d1f541f418dd1803436866104b56eeef292e4fe3f8c73f" :answer-field/choices ["q-342966/field-1/42d561329704e6c2c9d1f541f418dd1803436866104b56eeef292e4fe3f8c73f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-342966" :question/id #uuid "ce83776f-528c-5d17-8268-e8cfc7ca765f" :question/math-academy-id "q-342966" :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}$ for $y=6\\sqrt{x}+5\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n$\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=$ \n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6\\sqrt{x}+5\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6{x}^{1/2}+5\\operatorname{cos}⁡x) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{2})\\cdot 6{x}^{-1/2}+5(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =3{x}^{-1/2}-5\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{x}^{-1/2}-5\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =(-\\frac{1}{2})\\cdot 3{x}^{-3/2}-5\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{2\\sqrt{{x}^{3}}}-5\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-342966/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6afb4058-908a-5983-9c1e-78ee3fbadf44"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-342966"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-342970/field-1/32e7c5bcf66d01acf13b5e0547efac8a4e785294546f065ccb08317e1753a3f3" :answer/id #uuid "2d9a2c2e-fc38-5e8e-88d1-fd02e9e02055" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20x^3-3\\sin(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342970/field-1/b9076857e5f62bf3956d10c4888b2d1601a72500e2a8ed5a7bb7408d2b98584d" :answer/id #uuid "07945d3f-ce1d-5bb9-9cc3-351ac48960e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20x^3+3\\sin(x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-342970/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "69de21e6-3462-5ee8-a517-67cc95530a87" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-342970/field-1/32e7c5bcf66d01acf13b5e0547efac8a4e785294546f065ccb08317e1753a3f3" :answer-field/choices ["q-342970/field-1/32e7c5bcf66d01acf13b5e0547efac8a4e785294546f065ccb08317e1753a3f3" "q-342970/field-1/b9076857e5f62bf3956d10c4888b2d1601a72500e2a8ed5a7bb7408d2b98584d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-342970" :question/id #uuid "bf53fb97-0a34-5add-9287-11fb9e086842" :question/math-academy-id "q-342970" :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}$ for $y={x}^{5}+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}.$\n\n$\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}=$ \n{{field-1}}\n$-\\,\\frac{6}{{x}^{4}}$" :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{5}+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{5}+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-{x}^{-2}) \\\\  & =5{x}^{4}+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-(-2){x}^{-3} \\\\  & =5{x}^{4}+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+2{x}^{-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5{x}^{4}+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+2{x}^{-3}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot 5{x}^{3}+3(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)+(-3)\\cdot 2{x}^{-4} \\\\  & =20{x}^{3}-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\frac{6}{{x}^{4}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-342970/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6afb4058-908a-5983-9c1e-78ee3fbadf44"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-342970"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343089/field-1/033a2a3d3a8a533e356cf2ecfdeca69191aaf379d61659cd3cf9180d5f1878b7" :answer/id #uuid "6c86eee8-003a-5f16-95cc-c91b0a939d59" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3e^x+\\frac{8}{x^5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343089/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "52f8da1c-c96c-53d3-b46e-c7eff580b112" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-343089/field-1/033a2a3d3a8a533e356cf2ecfdeca69191aaf379d61659cd3cf9180d5f1878b7" :answer-field/choices ["q-343089/field-1/033a2a3d3a8a533e356cf2ecfdeca69191aaf379d61659cd3cf9180d5f1878b7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343089" :question/id #uuid "a0542d4a-bd9b-5120-97c1-74cf28d64656" :question/math-academy-id "q-343089" :question/problem "Given $f(x)=3{e}^{x}-\\frac{1}{3{x}^{2}},$ we have\n\n${f}^{‴}(x)=$ \n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Computing the first derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{e}^{x}-\\frac{1}{3{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{e}^{x}-\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{-2}) \\\\  & =3{e}^{x}+\\frac{2}{3}{x}^{-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the second derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{e}^{x}+\\frac{2}{3}{x}^{-3}) \\\\  & =3{e}^{x}-2{x}^{-4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, computing the third derivative, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{‴}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3{e}^{x}-2{x}^{-4}) \\\\  & =3{e}^{x}+8{x}^{-5} \\\\  & =3{e}^{x}+\\frac{8}{{x}^{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343089/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "322168bb-52e3-5352-a2e3-c5bdbf2bc13e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343089"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
